      "title": "Direct Trace Explorer & Scenario Links",
      "type": "text",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### 🔍 Explore Live Workflows\n\nClick any link below to open interactive trace waterfalls:\n\n- ⏱️ **[Scenario 1: Step Latencies & Concurrency (`order-service`)](/explore?left=%5B%22now-1h%22,%22now%22,%22jaeger%22,%7B%22query%22:%22%22,%22service%22:%22order-service%22%7D%5D)**\n  *Visualizes sequential steps alongside parallel fan-out branches.*\n\n- 🔁 **[Scenario 2: Retries & Backoff (`billing-service`)](/explore?left=%5B%22now-1h%22,%22now%22,%22jaeger%22,%7B%22query%22:%22%22,%22service%22:%22billing-service%22%7D%5D)**\n  *Visualizes transient failure attempts (`retry #2`, `retry #3`) and exception events.*\n\n- ⏪ **[Scenario 3: Sagas & Rollbacks (`travel-booking-service`)](/explore?left=%5B%22now-1h%22,%22now%22,%22jaeger%22,%7B%22query%22:%22%22,%22service%22:%22travel-booking-service%22%7D%5D)**\n  *Visualizes downstream failures and reverse LIFO compensation rollbacks.*\n\n- 🌐 **[Scenario 4: Distributed Tracing (`checkout-api` & `warehouse-worker`)](/explore?left=%5B%22now-1h%22,%22now%22,%22jaeger%22,%7B%22query%22:%22%22,%22service%22:%22checkout-api%22%7D%5D)**\n  *Visualizes cross-service parent-child context propagation (W3C `traceparent`).*\n\n---\n**External UI**: [Open Native Jaeger Tracing UI (http://localhost:16686)](http://localhost:16686)"
      }
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
