      "title": "Scenario Breakdown & Observed Attributes",
      "type": "text",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "| Service | Pattern Demonstrated | OpenTelemetry Attributes Recorded |\n|---|---|---|\n| `order-service` | **Latency & Concurrency** | `fluid.workflow.name`, `fluid.workflow.version`, `fluid.step.name`, `fluid.step.attempt`, step duration waterfall |\n| `billing-service` | **Retries & Backoff** | `fluid.step.attempt` (1, 2, 3), `status=ERROR` on failed attempts, `exception.message`, `delayMs` |\n| `travel-booking-service` | **Saga Rollbacks** | Workflow `status=ERROR`, `saga.action: rollback`, reverse compensation order (`refundPayment` &rarr; `releaseHotelRoom`) |\n| `checkout-api` & `warehouse-worker` | **Distributed W3C Tracing** | Single `traceId` shared across HTTP checkout API and async queue background worker |"
